# PURPOSE  Changes to how the assistant is deployed, what it is told, how its work is judged, and the agent rules
#          need an approval from one of these two (not the author).
# PSEUDOCODE  path pattern -> its owners; the last matching line wins. Replace the handles with yours and your
#             partner's. A ruleset with "Require review from Code Owners" makes the review binding.
/.github/workflows/ @your-handle @partner-handle
/deploy/ @your-handle @partner-handle
/main.py @your-handle @partner-handle
/requirements.txt @your-handle @partner-handle
/assistant/agent.py @your-handle @partner-handle
/evals/ @your-handle @partner-handle
/docs/agent-rules.md @your-handle @partner-handle
